<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paper stocks raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paper stocks raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--  CS First Boston said it upgraded Boise Cascade Corp and Bowater Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said it was recommending investors raise the weight of paper and forest product stocks in their portfolios to market weight from underweight.</p>
<p>-- Boise Cascade was up 1/2 to 33-5/8 and Bowater gained 7/8 to 39-1/8.</p>
</text>
